31361),(31366),(31371),(31372),(31376),(31398),(31400),(31404),(31408),(31409),(31410),(31411),(31412),(31413),(31416),(31421),(31432),(31446),(31454),(31455),(31491),(31494),(31499),(31506),(31520),(31527),(31551),(31556),(31573),(31574),(31575),(31579),(31589),(31590),(31591),(31597),(31602),(31603),(31607),(31608),(31617),(31619),(31632),(31635),(31646),(31647),(31655),(31658),(31677),(31682),(31692),(31700),(31714),(31716),(31718),(31720),(31726),(31727),(31729),(31732),(31762),(31763),(31765),(31769),(31774),(31786),(31797),(31812),(31813),(31816),(31819),(31853),(31855),(31884),(31889),(31895),(31901),(31902),(31904),(31907),(31915),(31916),(31940),(31952),(31982),(31986),(31989),(32003),(32007),(32021),(32042),(32043),(32049),(32060),(32065),(32066),(32088),(32089),(32101),(32112),(32183),(32202),(32203),(32209),(32212),(32218),(32239),(32240),(32241),(32244),(32246),(32251),(32264),(32265),(32266),(32269),(32270),(32280),(32282),(32283),(32296),(32297),(32304),(32307),(32311),(32316),(32339),(32345),(32357),(32371),(32387),(32403),(32404),(32411),(32419),(32427),(32428),(32456),(32460),(33004),(33009),(33010),(33011),(33012),(33017),(33030),(33041),(33051),(33112),(33114),(33135),(33136),(33137),(33161),(33167),(33170),(33186),(33187),(33189),(33192),(33198),(33199),(33201),(33213),(33220),(33228),(33231),(33237),(33257),(33259),(33264),(33266),(33270),(33271),(33274),(33278),(33283),(33313),(33319),(33383),(33388),(33394),(33395),(33415),(33416),(33420),(33424),(33435),(33441),(33484),(33485),(33509),(33513),(33523),(33524),(33526),(33530),(33533),(33548),(33551),(33559),(33570),(33608),(33635),(33640),(33641),(33678),(33682),(33685),(33686),(33712),(33719),(33720),(33723),(33771),(33773),(34089),(34105),(34112),(34119),(34121),(34128),(34132),(34177),(34208),(34307),(34308),(34312),(34314),(34329),(34417),(34422),(34433),(34441),(34450),(34451),(34456),(34477),(34480),(34488),(34510),(34520),(34521),(34522),(34524),(34578),(34599),(34617),(34644),(34657),(34665),(34666),(34689),(34697),(34703),(34722),(34725),(34759),(34764),(34767),(34773),(34788),(34821),(35000)) AS x(non_bitla_op_id) ), -- 1. Anchor: Capture ALL seats from the very first payment page hit First_Pay_Event AS ( SELECT mri_session_id, route_id, doj, CASE WHEN nbo.non_bitla_op_id IS NULL THEN 'Seat_Release_BO' ELSE 'Non_Seat_Release_BO' END AS bo_type, array_agg(st_no) AS first_seat_set, MIN(__time) AS first_pay_time FROM ( SELECT *, DENSE_RANK() OVER(PARTITION BY mri_session_id, route_id, doj ORDER BY __time) as event_rank FROM "user_interaction"."create_order_details" WHERE __time >= TIMESTAMP '2026-04-07 18:30:00' AND __time < TIMESTAMP '2026-04-08 18:30:00' AND country = 'IND' AND os = 'Android' ) a LEFT JOIN non_bitla_op nbo ON nbo.non_bitla_op_id = a.operator_id WHERE event_rank = 1 GROUP BY 1, 2, 3, 4 ), -- 2. STRICT SL VISIT: Only counts if the SL visit occurred AFTER the first payment hit SL_After AS ( SELECT sl.mri_session_id, sl.route_id, CAST(sl.doj AS DATE) doj, MIN(sl.__time) as first_sl_after_pay_time FROM "user_interaction"."seat_layout_details" sl INNER JOIN First_Pay_Event fp ON sl.mri_session_id = fp.mri_session_id AND sl.route_id = fp.route_id AND CAST(sl.doj AS DATE) = CAST(fp.doj AS DATE) WHERE __time >= TIMESTAMP '2026-04-07 18:30:00' AND __time < TIMESTAMP '2026-04-08 18:30:00' AND country = 'IND' AND os = 'Android' AND sl.__time > fp.first_pay_time -- THIS IS THE CRITICAL FILTER AND sl.__time <= fp.first_pay_time + INTERVAL '8' MINUTE GROUP BY 1, 2, 3 ), -- 3. Payment Re-entry: Must occur AFTER the SL_After visit Pay_Reentry AS ( SELECT p.mri_session_id, p.route_id, p.doj, MAX(CASE WHEN contains(fp.first_seat_set, p.st_no) THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) as has_same_seat FROM "user_interaction"."create_order_details" p INNER JOIN SL_After sla ON p.mri_session_id = sla.mri_session_id AND p.route_id = sla.route_id AND p.doj = sla.doj INNER JOIN First_Pay_Event fp ON p.mri_session_id = fp.mri_session_id WHERE p.__time > sla.first_sl_after_pay_time -- Sequence: Pay1 -> SL -> Pay2 AND p.__time <= fp.first_pay_time + INTERVAL '8' MINUTE GROUP BY 1, 2, 3 ), -- 4. Confirm Data: Sequenced after Re-entry Confirm_Data AS ( SELECT t.mri_session_id, t.route_id, DATE(t.date_of_journey) as doj, CASE WHEN any_match(t.seat_name, x -> contains(fp.first_seat_set, x)) THEN 'Same Seat' ELSE 'Different Seat' END AS seat_type FROM "transaction"."bus_ticket_events" t INNER JOIN Pay_Reentry pr ON t.mri_session_id = pr.mri_session_id AND t.route_id = pr.route_id INNER JOIN First_Pay_Event fp ON t.mri_session_id = fp.mri_session_id WHERE t.date_of_issue >= TIMESTAMP '2026-04-07 18:30:00' AND t.date_of_issue < TIMESTAMP '2026-04-08 18:30:00' AND t.event_type = 101 AND t.event_class = 2 ) -- FINAL FUNNEL SELECT fp.bo_type, COUNT(DISTINCT fp.mri_session_id) AS step1_landed_pay, COUNT(DISTINCT sla.mri_session_id) AS step2_sl_after_pay, COUNT(DISTINCT pr.mri_session_id) AS step3_total_reentry, COUNT(DISTINCT CASE WHEN pr.has_same_seat = 1 THEN pr.mri_session_id END) AS step3a_repay_same_seat, COUNT(DISTINCT CASE WHEN pr.has_same_seat = 0 THEN pr.mri_session_id END) AS step3b_repay_diff_seat, COUNT(DISTINCT CASE WHEN cd.seat_type = 'Same Seat' THEN cd.mri_session_id END) AS step4a_conf_same_seat, COUNT(DISTINCT CASE WHEN cd.seat_type = 'Different Seat' THEN cd.mri_session_id END) AS step4b_conf_diff_seat FROM First_Pay_Event fp LEFT JOIN SL_After sla ON fp.mri_session_id = sla.mri_session_id AND fp.route_id = sla.route_id AND fp.doj = sla.doj LEFT JOIN Pay_Reentry pr ON sla.mri_session_id = pr.mri_session_id AND sla.route_id = pr.route_id AND sla.doj = pr.doj LEFT JOIN Confirm_Data cd ON pr.mri_session_id = cd.mri_session_id AND pr.route_id = cd.route_id AND pr.doj = cd.doj GROUP BY 1
